{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/7a34c5614ab8bf5bfebee8ceb21bf356.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You seek untold riches, eternal life, divine powers - it leads to this accursed temple, a seemingly-infinite labyrinth of bottomless pits, deadly traps, and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.poster.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.webm?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.mp4?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/fb42c97670b5114a20485e9b8e65c90b.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Collect mystical Relics and an arsenal of weapons to make yourself unstoppable. Battle through hordes of enemies in dark, cavernous passages filled with traps and secrets of all sorts - fire-spewing statues, explosives, hidden spikes, and worse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/0d33dfbb58c6ba4292d93b183b0855d8.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Corruption builds in you with every step - encourage or ignore it, but each powerful curse can be a double-edged sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/55eea949037ec6e15add83ddc7a470fb.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Your greed will lead you to death, but that is not an escape. Rise to fight again. Delve deeper again. Defy the malignant deities that linger in this place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.poster.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.webm?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.mp4?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-based roguelike exploring a cruel, dark temple made of endless rooms and corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, spears, bows, guns - wield these and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and fire will be your best allies to overcome the threats that lie in the shadows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique curses influence each attempt, putting a twist on every action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies, with powerful champions and deadly bosses to face off against</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/46ef9ffc3efe6dd703ccad4f82302177.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Don\u2019t hesitate to join our official Passtech Games Discord server to share your experience with the Curse of the Dead Gods community!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d029b0abb1f92c4d4c2164da27f4dc5ba1251713.jpg","localized_name":"Initiation","name":"Initiation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/d029b0abb1f92c4d4c2164da27f4dc5ba1251713.jpg"},{"icon":"a0705455fae8d80c78d17724bc7514a2a513f097.jpg","localized_name":"Strength","name":"Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/a0705455fae8d80c78d17724bc7514a2a513f097.jpg"},{"icon":"48e671cef49daa028a969aa65bb11dde124c4b23.jpg","localized_name":"Toughness","name":"Toughness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/48e671cef49daa028a969aa65bb11dde124c4b23.jpg"},{"icon":"b0d599563d2962e6c3b4d92326c1ef200d5ad6f8.jpg","localized_name":"Cruelty","name":"Cruelty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/b0d599563d2962e6c3b4d92326c1ef200d5ad6f8.jpg"},{"icon":"913408893f7ad1aafccabb87de40a083b49c707e.jpg","localized_name":"Nobility","name":"Nobility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/913408893f7ad1aafccabb87de40a083b49c707e.jpg"},{"icon":"d39f45a255530707856607485696afe1622242f9.jpg","localized_name":"Invention","name":"Invention","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/d39f45a255530707856607485696afe1622242f9.jpg"},{"icon":"5157dfe98614f808cf0ea9c1e18444ba46cde319.jpg","localized_name":"Vanity","name":"Vanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/5157dfe98614f808cf0ea9c1e18444ba46cde319.jpg"},{"icon":"476d4a77a34b1aedcef8dce35f3172882537cf38.jpg","localized_name":"Awareness","name":"Awareness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/476d4a77a34b1aedcef8dce35f3172882537cf38.jpg"},{"icon":"718045c12dba36fe61979fddd11c643cba58c271.jpg","localized_name":"Depravity","name":"Depravity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/718045c12dba36fe61979fddd11c643cba58c271.jpg"},{"icon":"13368236b46a1ee4a94f0c04f0ef9e919edc42ef.jpg","localized_name":"Avidity","name":"Avidity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1123770/13368236b46a1ee4a94f0c04f0ef9e919edc42ef.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1123770?t=1727864458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1727864458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727864458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727864458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>LATEST UPDATE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/827394db7f5585bf4597daf59badc2e4.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Curse of the Dead Cells&quot; Update has been added to the game on April 2021. Major new features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dead Cells-themed content</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Curse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Curse of the Headless lets you kill faster with a visual twist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 New Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sword of Conjunctivius (based on the Cursed Sword of <i>Dead Cells</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Crossbow of the Condemned (based on the Explosive Crossbow of <i>Dead Cells</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Broadsword of the Knight (based on the Broadsword of <i>Dead Cells</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Challenge Room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete the new Cursed Chest challenge to earn rare items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Other new features</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A new two-handed fighting style: Bombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New Curse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New relics and relics icons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Assist mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More room variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out all the new content in our Curse of the Dead Cells Update patch notes.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/7a34c5614ab8bf5bfebee8ceb21bf356.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You seek untold riches, eternal life, divine powers - it leads to this accursed temple, a seemingly-infinite labyrinth of bottomless pits, deadly traps, and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.poster.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.webm?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/091fa6abdaac788e67b4582c2259971a.mp4?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/fb42c97670b5114a20485e9b8e65c90b.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Collect mystical Relics and an arsenal of weapons to make yourself unstoppable. Battle through hordes of enemies in dark, cavernous passages filled with traps and secrets of all sorts - fire-spewing statues, explosives, hidden spikes, and worse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/0d33dfbb58c6ba4292d93b183b0855d8.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Corruption builds in you with every step - encourage or ignore it, but each powerful curse can be a double-edged sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/55eea949037ec6e15add83ddc7a470fb.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Your greed will lead you to death, but that is not an escape. Rise to fight again. Delve deeper again. Defy the malignant deities that linger in this place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.poster.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.webm?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/66eb31edbbe0d93ab599a885295d4b8a.mp4?t=1727864458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-based roguelike exploring a cruel, dark temple made of endless rooms and corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, spears, bows, guns - wield these and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and fire will be your best allies to overcome the threats that lie in the shadows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique curses influence each attempt, putting a twist on every action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies, with powerful champions and deadly bosses to face off against</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/extras/46ef9ffc3efe6dd703ccad4f82302177.avif?t=1727864458\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Don\u2019t hesitate to join our official Passtech Games Discord server to share your experience with the Curse of the Dead Gods community!</p>","developers":["Passtech Games"],"dlc":[1556810],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123770/header.jpg?t=1727864458","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2019 Curse of the Dead Gods, developed by Passtech Games, published by Focus Home Interactive.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1123770/361369/44d61a0c65ccbfc15be5672f3487bee80455